<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Igniting VLMs toward the Embodied Space</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Andy Zhai
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Brae Liu
</span></span>
